{"articleNo":"2745","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2745&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-1학기 수강지도상담 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.31","hit":"18872","attachments":[{"name":"2011-1학기 수강지도상담 안내(학생용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2745&attachNo=2631"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수강지도상담 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2011학년도 1학기 “수강지도상담”을 아래와 같이 안내하오니, 해당 학생들은 수강지도기간에 지도교수와 상담하여 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">“</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수강승인”</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">을 받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 적용대상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 재학생에 한하여 실시(2011. 2. 1일 기준)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -37pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">제외자 : 2011학년도 1학기 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffccff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">복학자</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">․휴학자, 2011학년도 1학기 신(편)입생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 수강지도상담 기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 2011. 2. 1(화) 10:00 ~ 2. 14(월) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">상담내역</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;교</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">과목 이수체계도를 충분히 숙지하여 교육과정 이수에 문제가 발생하지 않도록 하며</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">, 부족한 학습 성과 항목을 체크하도록 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 유의 사항</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -34.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강지도 기간 중 지도교수와 상담을 하지 않아 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 수강신청기간에 수강신청을 할 수 없음.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 수강신청 페이지 로그인 불가</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강지도기간에 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 학부 사무실로 문의.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ “6. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내” 참고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 수강지도상담 방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">첨부파일 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\